	•	Section 2 Comments/Quotes: The final cohort had “30,606 adult heart transplants.” Table 1 reports 7,778 female recipients out of 30,606 total, which is 25.4%. Age was reported as median (Q1, Q3), not mean. Race/ethnicity and multiple comorbidities/history variables were reported, including diabetes, dialysis, prior surgery, infection requiring IV antibiotics, ventilator use, inotropes, VAD/ECMO/IABP, renal and liver function, and donor characteristics.

