	•	Section 4 Comments/Quotes: Missing data were handled with “multiple imputation by chained equations for parametric survival models” and “missForest for the random forest analysis,” so this fits best as Other. The paper describes exclusions, missingness rates, and imputation. No class-imbalance method or code release was reported. Exact training/test sizes were not given because the analyses were not based on a simple fixed split in the retrieved text.  ￼

